@startuml adr-r2-11-detach-notification-sequence
'
' ADR-R2-11 -- the ORDER of a detach announcement.
'
' This diagram exists because the order is LOAD-BEARING in that decision, not
' because a picture is nicer than prose.  Every one of the four position rules
' in section 2 of the ADR is a statement about what has NOT happened yet at the
' moment the broadcast runs:
'
'   * before Window::widgetDetached  -- that call runs application code
'                                       (closePopup -> popupClosed), so an
'                                       ancestor may already be dead after it;
'                                       broadcasting first needs no liveness
'                                       argument of its own.
'   * before the unlink              -- the whole departing subtree and the whole
'                                       ancestor chain are still alive and still
'                                       linked, so `node == content_` is a
'                                       comparison between objects that exist.
'   * before childRemoved            -- that is takeChild's SECOND door.
'   * before the destruction         -- the caller destroys, and only after the
'                                       subtree has been handed to it.
'
' Read together with docs/adr/adr-r2-11-detach-notification.md.
'
' NOT RENDERED: plantuml.jar is not installed on this machine.  The source is
' checked in; the PNG/SVG is to be produced when it is.  Nobody may claim this
' figure "ships" before that.
'
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 12

title ADR-R2-11: 广播 -> widgetDetached -> 解链 -> childRemoved -> 销毁\n(顺序是承重的)

participant "应用\nApplication" as App
participant "Widget::takeChild\n(宿主 parent)" as Take
participant "announceDetached\n(每节点, 前序)" as Ann
participant "ScrollArea\n(祖先, 缓存 content_)" as SA
participant "Window\n(focus_/hovered_/grab/popup)" as Win

App -> Take : removeChild(child) / takeChild(child)
activate Take

note right of Take
  REM3-G9 的 Debug assert 在这里:
  assert(!g_inDetachNotify)
  -- 钩子里再进这扇门就当场中止
end note

Take -> Take : child->update()\n(还挂在树上, 所以能定位到 Window)
Take -> Take : detail::DeathWatch alive(this)

Take -> Ann : announceDetached(parent, child, hint, win)
activate Ann

== 1. 广播 (第一条语句; 什么都还没动) ==

Ann -> Ann : detail::notifyDetachToAncestors(node)\nfor (a = node->parent(); a; a = a->parent())
Ann -> SA : onDescendantDetached(node)
activate SA
SA -> SA : if (node == content_)  content_  = nullptr\nif (node == viewport_) viewport_ = nullptr
note right of SA
  REM3-G9: 只准置空自己的成员指针。
  不得 update() / emit() / 改树 / 虚调用。
  == 所以这一步 **不跑应用代码** ==
end note
deactivate SA

note over Ann, SA
  此刻: 子树仍然完整、仍然挂在树上, 整条祖先链全部活着
  ==> 指针比较绝对安全, 广播不需要自己的存活性论证
end note

== 2. widgetDetached (这一步会跑应用代码) ==

Ann -> Ann : cancelOn(g_bubbles, node)\ncancelOn(g_geometries, node)
Ann -> Ann : detail::DeathWatch host(&parent)
Ann -> Win : widgetDetached(node)
activate Win
Win -> Win : 丢掉 focus_ / hovered_ / pressGrab_ / popup_\n中的任何一个指向 node 的
Win -->> App : closePopup -> popupClosed.emit()  ** 应用代码 **
note right of Win
  槽可以销毁别的 widget (D7 只禁止销毁信号自己的宿主)。
  所以返回之后, parent 与 node 都要重新证明还在。
end note
deactivate Win

Ann -> Ann : if (!host.alive()) return;\nif (!stillAChild(parent, node, hint)) return;
Ann -> Ann : 递归: 对 node 的每个子节点重复上述全部\n(所以是 **每节点** 而不是只有根)

Ann --> Take
deactivate Ann

Take -> Take : if (!alive.alive()) return nullptr;
Take -> Take : index = indexOfChild(children_, child)\n(重新找, 不复用旧下标)

== 3. 解链 (到这里才第一次改结构) ==

Take -> Take : owned = std::move(children_[index])\nchildren_.erase(...)\nowned->parent_ = nullptr

== 4. childRemoved (takeChild 的第二道门, 守卫作用域之外) ==

Take -> Take : if (detail::g_layoutHosts != 0) childRemoved(index)
note right of Take
  ADR-R2-01 的门控: 不装 Layout 的 widget 一条都不执行。
  这扇门之后 **不得再有任何成员访问** -- 只剩 return owned;
end note

Take --> App : return owned  (所有权交给调用者)
deactivate Take

== 5. 销毁 (由调用者决定, 不由本机制决定) ==

App -> App : removeChild: doomed.reset()\n或 takeChild: 调用者继续持有 -> 子树还活着
note right of App
  takeChild 之后子树 **仍然活着**, 只是脱离了树。
  所以 ~Widget 不需要这个钩子, 而 DeathWatch 的取消
  策略是 "析构取消, 摘除不取消" (Q4)。
end note

@enduml
